Package: brainwritR
Title: Resilient Classroom Brainwriting with Shiny
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Run a self-hosted classroom adaptation of 6-3-5 brainwriting.
    Rotating topics, persistent drafts, participant reconnection, and a
    database-authoritative round clock support small groups using smartphones.
    Includes a multilingual Shiny application, pure rotation helpers,
    three device modes, portable session settings, descriptive text analysis,
    and tabular and two-page report exports for facilitated debriefing.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/brainwritR, https://cttir.github.io/brainwritR/
BugReports: https://github.com/CTTIR/brainwritR/issues
